OL,3,GNEWSAHorse paddock to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto new woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-acre (2.45 hectare) horse paddock
OL,7,Fis to be turned into a community
OL,8,Fwoodland.
OL,10,FOver the next two years, more than
OL,11,F3,100 native trees of differing
OL,12,Fvarieties will be planted by volunteers
OL,13,Fat Gawthrops Meadow, on the outskirts
OL,14,Fof Kettering.
OL,16,FThe project has been funded by the
OL,17,FForestry Commission and will aim to
OL,18,Fimprove biodiversity, expand habitats
OL,19,Fand enhance the green space for
OL,20,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
