OL,3,GNEWSAHorse paddock to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto new woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Pearce, from the commission,
OL,7,Fsaid he was "delighted" to see the
OL,8,Flocal community playing a part in the
OL,9,Fplans.
